SUMMARY:Losing weight\, losing lean mass too?
DESCRIPTION:Dinner is done\, the chai is cold\, and the question stays: wha
 t am I losing along with the weight?\nIn patients with obesity treated wit
 h GLP-1 receptor agonists at obesity doses\, absolute lean mass changed by
  -1.74 kg (95% CI: -3.04 to -0.45\; p < 0.00001)\; results varied a lot be
 tween studies (I² = 98%).\nA meta-analysis of 7 studies (821 patients) fo
 und that lean mass as a share of total weight rose 1.81% (95% CI: 1.1 to 2
 .52\; p < 0.00001\; I² = 7%) in patients with obesity treated with GLP-1 
 receptor agonists at obesity doses.\nPost folder: posts/run-e4d5ed8559e6/p
 ost-3aa016d5\nPending doctor review.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:post-b9efc2f8@steer
