DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261021T190000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261021T193000
SUMMARY:Is it safe?
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about GLP-1 medicines and wondering about side effects
 ? Fair question.\nIn trials\, higher doses of this class of medicines were
  linked to higher risks of nausea\, vomiting\, diarrhea\, constipation and
  decreased appetite. A doctor weighs the benefits against the side effects
 .\nOnly one trial looked at the risk of abdominal discomfort in patients r
 eceiving GLP-1 medicines.\nPost folder: posts/run-b78a76213417/post-b9efc2
 f8\nPending doctor review.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
