SUMMARY:Will I lose muscle along the way?
DESCRIPTION:Worried about muscle when you start a weight programme? Fair qu
 estion.\nThe authors state the percentage of lean mass fell from baseline 
 in all subgroups\, and they pair treatment with nutrition and exercise.\nT
 alk to a Steer doctor\nPost folder: posts/run-e4d5ed8559e6/post-72926563\n
 Pending doctor review.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
